WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:03.952
Tarot began as a card game in northern
Italy.

00:00:03.952 --> 00:00:06.459
Its use for reading came centuries later.

00:00:07.759 --> 00:00:11.060
A card game in northern Italy, 1440s.

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:21.854
The earliest known tarot cards were made in northern Italy in the
1440s, in cities including Milan, Ferrara and Florence.

00:00:23.154 --> 00:00:26.881
From trionfi to tarocchi, 1500s to 1700s.

00:00:26.881 --> 00:00:37.516
By the early 1500s the name tarocchi was in use, and the game
spread across Italy and into France and central Europe.

00:00:38.916 --> 00:00:41.236
Have a tarot spread in front of you?

00:00:41.236 --> 00:00:45.940
Photograph it at readmyspread.com, and get
a clear reading, card by card.
